msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:155
#: 3c105070797e4f40852ceb62ea58e73a
msgid "Check the throttle is at full in the Flight Data screen's Status tab by checking \"ch3in\" is very high (around 1900 usually)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-joystick.rst:157
#: f10aa329c4474ecbad372b29c21f4005
msgid "On the Joystick screen push the **Disable** button and check the \"ch3in\" has dropped to a mid value (around 1500)"
